 "rule": "Prompt-representative design, one main stage. Positions are grouped by prompt sha256 in the manifest order of histories.json; the representative of a group is its first position, its index is the group's index in that order, its seed is the stage-1 repeat-0 seed sha256('tap-live-decode:calls:<history_id>:0'). ALL groups are run uncapped (no per-call cap; natural stop or the 240,000-token total-context ceiling, recorded as context_ceiling), both arms, the arm order alternating by representative index (A0 first for even, A1 first for odd). Every position keeps its preselected weight 1 / n_positions and takes its group's representative pair. Stage-1 pairs are supporting data only. Distinct prompts are never merged.",
